{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\"sec\":\"\",\"mech\":\"\",\"why\":\"没有。最接近的是S02-M15，它声称彼此的心意第一次显得能够相通，但其解释缺少对方真实回应的依据，直接从自己的亲近感推到了双方心意相通；S02-M22也有同样的问题。S02-M16只说自己的心意仿佛有可能被对方懂得，S02-M17等候选则仍明确保留着对方是否同感的不确定。S03-M11虽然以已经得到真实回应为前提，却没有在该段内建立这一事实。因此，没有候选能够在不补造设定的情况下，确立双方真实相通且对方确实理解他的经历这一前提。\"}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "bc1697bc-e08a-4da0-bb1b-11a9ed07ff2a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T044026814811Z", "elapsed_seconds": 47.718, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T04:41:14.548007+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "bfb6637bbb00f1683cf6c827bd707e61e06a6f0865123091cced312d6d7775d0", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", 